{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32214","headline":"李羽处士寄新醖走笔戏酬 · 温庭筠","name":"李羽处士寄新醖走笔戏酬","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高谈有伴还成薮，沈醉无期即是乡。\n已恨流莺欺谢客，更将浮蚁与刘郎。\n檐前柳色分张绿，窗外花枝借助香。\n所恨玳筵红烛夜，草玄寥落近廻塘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32214.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32214","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}